  "goodToKnow": "Bekehren means to convert someone to a faith or opinion: jemanden zum Christentum bekehren, and humorously, zum Vegetarismus bekehren. Sich bekehren means to be converted. Die Bekehrung des Paulus (on the road to Damascus) gave English its Damascus moment. The Anglo-Saxon missionary Boniface worked to bekehren the Germanic tribes in the 8th century. Konvertieren is the neutral word for changing religion yourself."
